<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A new generation of humanity is on the horizon with the ability to connect to any piece of computerized machinery and manipulate its code to their will through their mind and the foundation has found and contained The First.</p>
<p><strong>The First:</strong> Has normal teenager appearances. He is the first person to have been spotted with such abilities. Hacks into the foundation database almost everyday in hope to find someone like him (the foundation is close to developing a software to protect their database). Isn't really cooperative due to being separated from his parents and knows that he will never be able to see them. Hobbies include singing, reading fictional books.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention Grabber:</strong> Besides the common ability mentioned above. These &quot;Evolves&quot; have a unique ability. &quot;The First&quot; I want this article on has the unique ability to engineer a virus which attacks on the human brain and shuts it down in 2-3 days. When an infected is in contact with any computer, the virus will inject some of its code which will act as a computer virus capable of taking down the entire NASA Database in a single day.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I have not started a draft on this yet but will do it as soon as/if I get the greenlights required. Would love as many suggestions, critiques on this as I can get.</p>

