<p>Hello hello <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackrawthewriter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7092506); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7092506&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608115847" alt="JackrawTheWriter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7092506)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackrawthewriter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7092506); return false;">JackrawTheWriter</a></span>! Welcome to the Wiki! I'm Ralliston, a site author and a member of the Community Outreach Team - with this helpful little comment, I'll try to help you find your way around the site and link a bunch of useful places and links that will help you in your SCP journey.</p>
<p>It's awesome you finally decided to make an account - after all, only by voting, which only people with one can, can you actively affect the quality of works posted onsite. I'm also happy to see you quite want to contribute, too - I can't wait to see what you come up with, I'm sure it will be awesome!</p>
<p>Without further ado though, let's click the collapsible, shall we? :)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
