<p>what are 'cult like acts'?</p>
<p>I guess, at the end of the day, my biggest concern with this is that it feels like it has a lot of moving parts and complexity to it but none of the narrative really <em>goes</em> anywhere: it feels like this is all setting for a cool story but I really want to see what the cool story actually is, y'know? I want to see how the Foundation struggles with this, I want to see where their struggle leads them, I want to see how all the elements come together to really convey the sense of horror you're aiming for, y'know?</p>

